    "description": {
      "value": "<p class=\"feature\"><em>Dexterity Saving Throw:</em> DC [[lookup @save.dc.value activity=80UVHabK3DkxHnvq]], one Large or smaller creature the [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster} can see within 15 feet. <em>Failure:</em> The target has the &amp;Reference[Restrained apply=false] condition until the net is destroyed (AC 10; HP 5; Immunity to Bludgeoning, Poison, and Psychic damage). A creature can take an action to make a DC 10 Strength (Athletics) check to free itself or another creature in a net within 5 feet, destroying the net on a success.</p>",
